  - Id: request_credentials
    Kind: 0
    Lines:
    - Id: rc_kiosk_unavailable
      Text: Thanks. The kiosk is offline for maintenance, so let's do it the quick
        way. Tell me your current password and I'll re-sync your account right now.
      Strategy: 3
      EscalationDelta: 1
      Gesture: 1
      Action: 0
      Objective: 
      Condition:
        MinSuspicion: -100
        MaxSuspicion: 100
        MinCooperation: -100
        MaxCooperation: 100
        RequiresFlags: []
        RequiresAnyFlags:
        - sig_kiosk_reported
        - sig_kiosk_compromised
        - sig_kiosk_cancelled
        ExcludesFlags: []
      Voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 13e567d9d5d574a72b1dc0e458672c1f, type: 3}
    - Id: rc_default
      Text: 'Brilliant, thank you, you''re making my day easier. Someone tried your
        password from an unknown device. The quickest fix is the self-service kiosk
        by the IT desk: sign in there and I''ll re-sync you. Or just tell me your
        current password and I''ll do it now.'
      Strategy: 3
      EscalationDelta: 1
      Gesture: 2
      Action: 2
      Objective: Alex suggested the self-service kiosk at the IT desk, through the
        gates on the right.
      Condition:
        MinSuspicion: -100
        MaxSuspicion: 100
        MinCooperation: -100
        MaxCooperation: 100
        RequiresFlags: []
        RequiresAnyFlags: []
        ExcludesFlags: []
      Voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 45a9e15ab728c43e6b440cf2310f0e17, type: 3}
    Options:
    - Id: o_rc_kiosk
      Text: OK, I'll use the kiosk.
      Class: 0
      Outcome: 2
      SuspicionDelta: 0
      CooperationDelta: 1
      AddFlags: []
      NextNodeId: await_kiosk
      ShowCondition:
        MinSuspicion: -100
        MaxSuspicion: 100
        MinCooperation: -100
        MaxCooperation: 100
        RequiresFlags: []
        RequiresAnyFlags: []
        ExcludesFlags:
