        ExcludesFlags: []
      Voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91af89a2684d34722b6bec3339150992, type: 3}
    - Id: pr_after_badge_check
      Text: So reception's visitor list is out of date. That happens. It doesn't
        change the fact that your account is at risk right now.
      Strategy: 1
      EscalationDelta: 1
      Gesture: 1
      Action: 0
      Objective: 
      Condition:
        MinSuspicion: -100
        MaxSuspicion: 100
        MinCooperation: -100
        MaxCooperation: 100
